es speaks to Dr Khan because he wants to\nA. confirm his own diagnosis.\nB. hear Dr Khan’s diagnosis.\nC. send the patient for tests.", "sourcePage": 1, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 358, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92", "filename": "Listening Part B-answers.docx", "sha256": "67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "\nYou hear a dietician talking to a patient.\nWhat is she doing?\nA. Showing the patient alternative diet plans that eliminate fat.\nB. Explaining why the doctor wants the patient to eat a low-fat diet.\nC. Empathising with the patient about the challenges of reducing fat.", "sourcePage": 1, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 637, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92", "filename": "Listening Part B-answers.docx", "sha256": "67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "\nYou hear a professor of emergency medicine giving a presentation to a group of trainee\ndoctors.\nThe presentation is about\nA. why European wasps are a problem.\nB. what European wasps like to eat.\nC. how European wasps sting.", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 0, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92", "filename": "Listening Part B-answers.docx", "sha256": "67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "\nYou hear a GP talking to a regular patient who has been having kidney problems.\nWhat does the GP suggest?\nA. That the patient’s lifestyle will change forever.\nB. That there is more than one way to treat the patient.\nC. That the patient needs dialysis for the rest of their life.", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 323, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92", "filename": "Listening Part B-answers.docx", "sha256": "67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "\nYou hear a physiotherapist in a hospital talking with John, a new patient.\nThe physiotherapist is\nA. providing sports recovery options.\nB. explaining why warm showers are beneficial.\nC. giving instructions to assist with recovery from an injury.", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 701, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92", "filename": "Listening Part B-answers.docx", "sha256": "67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "\nYou hear a specialist physician and a nurse discussing a patient’s treatment.\nThe nurse is unable to help the physician because\nA. she isn't senior enough\nB. she isn't familiar with the patient.\nC. she doesn't understand the treatment options.", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 19, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92", "filename": "Listening Part B-answers.docx", "sha256": "67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["5276df4d58ba55a81ab557db933fe0b8b752c958e878c017d4e96b6889ef42c0"], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92", "filename": "Listening Part B-answers.docx", "sha256": "67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/67dc229f3dc92bc8cc92356e53881fa44dc3adb62e1e6f84d65c4c1cb8cf5b7f.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}], "passages": []}, {"id": "0df7d9314810b8be-p1", "label": "Part C · Part C.pdf", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "0df7d9314810b8be6a5b10243f80976c10cff1e50705e3bf40fd2403b0f7a5f5", "pages": [1, 2], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "\nWhat does Dr Dugan suggest defines a patient’s health literacy?\nA. how frequently they use available health services.\nB. how well they communicate with health professionals.\nC. how clearly they understand health-related information.", "sourcePage": 1, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 392, "answer": {"text": "No transcript", "source": {"id": "offline-386fecdfac8b8b1b4c13", "filename": "Listening Part C- Health Literacy answers.docx", "sha256": "386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "\nAs a result of her own research, and other studies, Dr Dugan believes\nA. most patients don't listen carefully enough to health professionals.\nB. patient health outcomes rely heavily on a person's health literacy.\nC. governments aren't doing enough to assist with health literacy.", "sourcePage": 1, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 664, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-386fecdfac8b8b1b4c13", "filename": "Listening Part C- Health Literacy answers.docx", "sha256": "386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "\nDr Dugan says most health professionals have at one time\nA. had complaints made about their poor communication.\nB. incorrectly assumed their instructions were understood.\nC. forgotten how to speak to patients in their own language.", "sourcePage": 1, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 983, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-386fecdfac8b8b1b4c13", "filename": "Listening Part C- Health Literacy answers.docx", "sha256": "386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "\nWhy does Dr Dugan share the examples about previous patients?\nA. to show how she teaches health literacy.\nB. to illustrate findings from recent research studies.\nC. to demonstrate the importance of clear communication.", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 0, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-386fecdfac8b8b1b4c13", "filename": "Listening Part C- Health Literacy answers.docx", "sha256": "386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "\nThe paediatrician example about the \"teach-back\" method demonstrates\nA. how easy it is to overlook whether or not a patient has understood instructions.\nB. what patients do and do not understand about health literacy.\nC. the best way to confirm what a patient understands.", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 258, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-386fecdfac8b8b1b4c13", "filename": "Listening Part C- Health Literacy answers.docx", "sha256": "386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "\nWhat does Dr Dugan make about improving patient safety and care?\nA. It is essential to have reliable health care for all patients.\nB. Focusing on acute care settings is the most important aspect.\nC. Delivery of information beyond the traditional care settings is vital.", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 570, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-386fecdfac8b8b1b4c13", "filename": "Listening Part C- Health Literacy answers.docx", "sha256": "386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-386fecdfac8b8b1b4c13", "filename": "Listening Part C- Health Literacy answers.docx", "sha256": "386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, {"id": "offline-a8e1155688f802cd3f22", "filename": "Listening Part C- Saturated Fats answers.docx", "sha256": "a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}], "passages": []}, {"id": "0df7d9314810b8be-p3", "label": "Part C · Listening Part C: Saturated Fats", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "0df7d9314810b8be6a5b10243f80976c10cff1e50705e3bf40fd2403b0f7a5f5", "pages": [3, 4], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "\nDr Marshall believes that the low-fat era is coming to an end because\nA. the US Dietary Guidelines have changed towards fat.\nB. 35 years ago the US Dietary Guidelines were very different.\nC. fat and cholesterol are no longer linked in the US Dietary Guidelines.", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 229, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-a8e1155688f802cd3f22", "filename": "Listening Part C- Saturated Fats answers.docx", "sha256": "a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "\nDr Marshall suggests that LDL particles\nA. are more dangerous when they’re smaller.\nB. have nothing to do with saturated fat.\nC. pose no risk to a person’s health.", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 530, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-a8e1155688f802cd3f22", "filename": "Listening Part C- Saturated Fats answers.docx", "sha256": "a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "\nWhat are Dr Marshall's views on saturated fats?\nA. Refined carbohydrates are more dangerous than saturated fat.\nB. Not all saturated fats are the same as others.\nC. Vegetable oil should replace saturated fat.", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 735, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-a8e1155688f802cd3f22", "filename": "Listening Part C- Saturated Fats answers.docx", "sha256": "a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "\nWhy doesn't Dr Marshall believe people should stop worrying about cholesterol?\nA. Biological solutions haven’t been able to solve the problem.\nB. People continue to eat too many foods high in fat and sugar.\nC. More research is required to understand how fat enters the blood.", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 0, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-a8e1155688f802cd3f22", "filename": "Listening Part C- Saturated Fats answers.docx", "sha256": "a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "\nDr Marshall says there is no agreement over nutritional science because\nA. there are too many opinions when it comes to a person’s diet.\nB. there are a lot of different ways to interpret the information.\nC. there isn’t enough money to fund high quality research.", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 315, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-a8e1155688f802cd3f22", "filename": "Listening Part C- Saturated Fats answers.docx", "sha256": "a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "\nIn Dr Marshall's opinion, many organisations and experts need to\nA. become more open-minded about embracing current studies.\nB. encourage more people to eat a diet high in vegetables.\nC. stop saying that eating saturated fat is bad.", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "offset": 617, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-a8e1155688f802cd3f22", "filename": "Listening Part C- Saturated Fats answers.docx", "sha256": "a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-386fecdfac8b8b1b4c13", "filename": "Listening Part C- Health Literacy answers.docx", "sha256": "386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/386fecdfac8b8b1b4c131508f2d1c8d9a48b83dc61bc89f1b4a2edd62c663ceb.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}, {"id": "offline-a8e1155688f802cd3f22", "filename": "Listening Part C- Saturated Fats answers.docx", "sha256": "a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/a8e1155688f802cd3f2248246995280f5ca2a1dbfb9c3e4b05851ac2808562e9.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}], "passages": []}]}
